Subject: [PATCH] feat(tool_search): tools.tool_search.eager keeps named tools
 (incl. plugin tools) out of the bridge [daveey]

---
 hermes_cli/config_defaults.py   |  3 ++
 tests/tools/test_tool_search.py | 69 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/tool_search.py            | 33 +++++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hermes_cli/config_defaults.py b/hermes_cli/config_defaults.py
